      "role": "user",
      "content": "That's a really strong start, I like the way you framed the dialogue between those specific houses. It feels very much like our tone.\n\nCan you expand on this? I especially want to look at how this \"tactile minimalism\" is impacting color palettes and the use of accessories. Try to keep that same level of depth, but maybe touch on how those other brands in the list—like Bottega Veneta, Chanel, or Louis Vuitton—are playing into these textures or silhouettes. \n\nAgain, just make sure it flows naturally. I'd rather have a slightly lower discovery score than a piece that reads like a blatant SEO attempt.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
